d 'CSPMED': module to perform causal mediation analysis for cross-sectional and complex-survey data with one or more mediators: weighted OLS, logit, probit, 2SLS and DML
d
d  cspmed is Stata command for causal mediation analysis using
d cross-sectional and complex-survey data. It accommodates one or
d more mediators and supports weighted OLS, logit, probit, 2SLS and
d double/debiased machine learning (DML), with design-based
d (Taylor-linearised) inference and diagnostic procedures. 
d
d KW: causal mediation
d KW: cross-section
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261114
d
d Author:  Yusuf Toyin Yusuf,  Kwara State University
d Support: email  YUSUF.YUSUF@@KWASU.EDU.NG
d
d Author: Francis Baidoo, Koforidua Technical University
d Support: email ytoyinyusuf@@gmail.com
d
f cspmed.ado
f cspmed.sthlp
f cspmed_cert_survey.dta
f cspmed_cert.do
